- Sections 1 and 2: Milk (2/7 of the total length)
- Sections 3, 4, 5, 6, and 7: Water (5/7 of the total length)
Use Manim's `Rectangle` or `Line` animations to draw the tape diagram, and `Text` animations to label each section. The animation should clearly visualize the 2:5 ratio of milk to water in the mixture.
</final_translation>
